{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boy named Nero, born from a mysterious portal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To him, the girl named Snoa, who was always by his side, meant everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But one day, a sudden catastrophe twisted the world, leaving Nero completely alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, in a realm swallowed by darkness, he begins a perilous journey to find her.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u201cFind her.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/82623877d8cd9eeae1fadf26de9fcfbb.poster.avif?t=1758065115\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/82623877d8cd9eeae1fadf26de9fcfbb.webm?t=1758065115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/82623877d8cd9eeae1fadf26de9fcfbb.mp4?t=1758065115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Nero, a boy chasing after the traces of Snoa.<br>Through the ruins of a broken world, memories of their time together resurface.<br>The magic and cloak she left behind will guide you through the dangers ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u201cIf they see you, you die.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/2a1dd846af85bc0aff0d51866a71a9e3.poster.avif?t=1758065115\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/2a1dd846af85bc0aff0d51866a71a9e3.webm?t=1758065115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/2a1dd846af85bc0aff0d51866a71a9e3.mp4?t=1758065115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is filled with towering, grotesque beings with twisted movements.<br>The moment they detect you, there is no resistance\u2014only disappearance.<br>Stay hidden. Only the shadows can keep you safe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u201cRun if you want to live.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/8449a2faa164bc6545a5b07dc71563a4.poster.avif?t=1758065115\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/8449a2faa164bc6545a5b07dc71563a4.webm?t=1758065115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/8449a2faa164bc6545a5b07dc71563a4.mp4?t=1758065115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiding isn't always enough.<br>If you're spotted, your only choice is to run.<br>Leap, dodge, and scramble past obstacles to reach safety\u2026 if it still exists.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u201cDestroy the heart of the Transcendents.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/610a25dd75d1315678f61f90e85bf5d7.poster.avif?t=1758065115\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/610a25dd75d1315678f61f90e85bf5d7.webm?t=1758065115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/610a25dd75d1315678f61f90e85bf5d7.mp4?t=1758065115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These entities\u2014called Transcendents\u2014rule over this broken world with overwhelming presence.<br>If you face them, you will die.<br>But for some unknown reason, you awaken in a hidden dimension housing their heart.<br>Gain mysterious powers, destroy the structures guarding the heart, and bring them down.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u201cUncover the truth.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/8ebf1783819ac78e518802807be9a0ed.poster.avif?t=1758065115\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/8ebf1783819ac78e518802807be9a0ed.webm?t=1758065115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/8ebf1783819ac78e518802807be9a0ed.mp4?t=1758065115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did they destroy this world?<br>What is the true nature of the power Nero has gained?<br>And where\u2026 is Snoa now?<br>Piece together the clues, discover the truth, and find her again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Whatever awaits\u2026 keep moving.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3450900?t=1758065115","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/c760190239ba1e0550f1b7ea6b19975b8b63e573/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758065115","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/0d8abbe93068ed5f835d98aebb33b3a6934d2dba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758065115","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/0d8abbe93068ed5f835d98aebb33b3a6934d2dba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758065115","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3491210,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boy named Nero, born from a mysterious portal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To him, the girl named Snoa, who was always by his side, meant everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But one day, a sudden catastrophe twisted the world, leaving Nero completely alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, in a realm swallowed by darkness, he begins a perilous journey to find her.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u201cFind her.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/82623877d8cd9eeae1fadf26de9fcfbb.poster.avif?t=1758065115\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/82623877d8cd9eeae1fadf26de9fcfbb.webm?t=1758065115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/82623877d8cd9eeae1fadf26de9fcfbb.mp4?t=1758065115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Nero, a boy chasing after the traces of Snoa.<br>Through the ruins of a broken world, memories of their time together resurface.<br>The magic and cloak she left behind will guide you through the dangers ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u201cIf they see you, you die.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/2a1dd846af85bc0aff0d51866a71a9e3.poster.avif?t=1758065115\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/2a1dd846af85bc0aff0d51866a71a9e3.webm?t=1758065115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/2a1dd846af85bc0aff0d51866a71a9e3.mp4?t=1758065115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is filled with towering, grotesque beings with twisted movements.<br>The moment they detect you, there is no resistance\u2014only disappearance.<br>Stay hidden. Only the shadows can keep you safe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u201cRun if you want to live.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/8449a2faa164bc6545a5b07dc71563a4.poster.avif?t=1758065115\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/8449a2faa164bc6545a5b07dc71563a4.webm?t=1758065115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/8449a2faa164bc6545a5b07dc71563a4.mp4?t=1758065115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hiding isn't always enough.<br>If you're spotted, your only choice is to run.<br>Leap, dodge, and scramble past obstacles to reach safety\u2026 if it still exists.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u201cDestroy the heart of the Transcendents.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/610a25dd75d1315678f61f90e85bf5d7.poster.avif?t=1758065115\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/610a25dd75d1315678f61f90e85bf5d7.webm?t=1758065115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/610a25dd75d1315678f61f90e85bf5d7.mp4?t=1758065115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These entities\u2014called Transcendents\u2014rule over this broken world with overwhelming presence.<br>If you face them, you will die.<br>But for some unknown reason, you awaken in a hidden dimension housing their heart.<br>Gain mysterious powers, destroy the structures guarding the heart, and bring them down.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u201cUncover the truth.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/8ebf1783819ac78e518802807be9a0ed.poster.avif?t=1758065115\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/8ebf1783819ac78e518802807be9a0ed.webm?t=1758065115\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/8ebf1783819ac78e518802807be9a0ed.mp4?t=1758065115\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why did they destroy this world?<br>What is the true nature of the power Nero has gained?<br>And where\u2026 is Snoa now?<br>Piece together the clues, discover the truth, and find her again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Whatever awaits\u2026 keep moving.</strong></p>","developers":["Black Cheeze"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","